 "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@5aff595/content/data/versions/954.json"}, {"content_hash": "4caba5ee3d180c86", "version_id": 955, "article_id": 96, "level_code": "en_c1", "lang": "en", "level": 5, "level_label": "C1 高级", "title": "Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang resigns after 33 years", "title_zh": "执掌33年后，黄仁勋突然辞去英伟达CEO", "has_translation": true, "topic": "tech", "source": "ifanr", "source_url": "https://www.ifanr.com/1689249?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542744095-fcf48d80b0fd?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8MTB8fGNlb3xlbnwwfDB8fHwxNzk0NTM1MzI4fDA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Campaign Creators on Unsplash", "author": "Campaign Creators", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@campaign_creators?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/people-sitting-near-table-with-laptop-computer-qCi_MzVODoU?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(76, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(114, 46%, 48%)", "label": "TECH", "seed": "04848d0d90e2"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-13", "word_count": 327, "reading_minutes": 1.6, "lead": "Jensen Huang, who built Nvidia into the backbone of the global AI computing market, has stepped down as chief executive with immediate effect. Chief financial officer Colette Kress takes over on an interim basis while the board searches for a permanent successor.", "lead_zh": "把英伟达做成全球AI算力市场核心的黄仁勋，已即刻辞去首席执行官一职。首席财务官科莱特·克雷斯暂时接任，董事会则开始物色正式接班人。", "preview": "Nvidia announced on November 12 that Huang had resigned as CEO, president and board director, effective immediately. The departure follows a", "preview_zh": "英伟达11月12日宣布，黄仁勋已辞去首席执行官、总裁及董事职务，即刻生效。此前一周风波不断：11月8日董事会启动独立调查并聘请外部律师，同时坚称没有理由认为美国国家安全或公司商业秘密受到损害，并表示仍信任黄仁勋及其团队。但短短几天内，这份信任显然已经崩塌。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id